<div class="container">

<!-- =============================== -->
<!-- ====== 模块一：概念讲解 ====== -->
<!-- =============================== -->
<section id="concept" class="visible">

  <!-- 1. 什么是长方形 -->
  <div class="card">
    <h2>🔍 什么是长方形？</h2>
    <p>
      长方形是一种特别的<span class="hl-blue">四边形</span>，它有<span class="hl-red">4条边</span>和<span class="hl-red">4个直角</span>（每个角都是90°）。
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:12px;">
      其中，<span class="hl-blue">较长的两条边</span>叫做<span class="hl-purple">「长」</span>，<span class="hl-green">较短的两条边</span>叫做<span class="hl-green">「宽」</span>。
    </p>
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:20px;">
      <svg width="320" height="200" viewBox="0 0 320 200">
        <!-- 长方形 -->
        <rect x="50" y="30" width="220" height="130" rx="2"
              fill="rgba(79,195,247,0.12)" stroke="#1565c0" stroke-width="3"/>
        <!-- 直角标记 -->
        <polyline points="50,55 75,55 75,30" fill="none" stroke="#e53935" stroke-width="2"/>
        <polyline points="245,30 245,55 270,55" fill="none" stroke="#e53935" stroke-width="2" transform="translate(0,100)"/>
        <!-- 标注"长" -->
        <line x1="50" y1="185" x2="270" y2="185" stroke="#7c4dff" stroke-width="2" marker-start="url(#arrowL)" marker-end="url(#arrowR)"/>
        <defs>
          <marker id="arrowL" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="8" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M8,0 L0,4 L8,8" fill="#7c4dff"/></marker>
          <marker id="arrowR" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="0" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8" fill="#7c4dff"/></marker>
          <marker id="arrowU" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="4" refY="8" orient="auto"><path d="M0,8 L4,0 L8,8" fill="#2e7d32"/></marker>
          <marker id="arrowD" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="4" refY="0" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L4,8 L8,0" fill="#2e7d32"/></marker>
        </defs>
        <text x="160" y="198" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7c4dff" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">长</text>
        <!-- 标注"宽" -->
        <line x1="300" y1="30" x2="300" y2="160" stroke="#2e7d32" stroke-width="2" marker-start="url(#arrowU)" marker-end="url(#arrowD)"/>
        <text x="310" y="100" fill="#2e7d32" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" transform="rotate(90,310,100)">宽</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. 长方形的特征 -->
  <div class="card">
    <h2>⭐ 长方形的特征</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>有 <span class="hl-red">4 条边</span>，<span class="hl-blue">对边相等</span>（上面和下面一样长，左面和右面一样长）</li>
      <li>有 <span class="hl-red">4 个角</span>，全部都是 <span class="hl-purple">直角（90°）</span></li>
      <li>有 <span class="hl-red">4 条对称轴</span>中的 <span class="hl-blue">2 条对称轴</span>（沿长或宽的中点对折，两边完全重合）</li>
      <li>长方形是特殊的 <span class="hl-orange">平行四边形</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- 3. 长方形 vs 正方形 -->
  <div class="card">
    <h2>🆚
